.TH WERKMEISTER-RESUME 1 "" "werkmeister" "Werkmeister Manual"
.SH NAME
werkmeister\-resume \- Thaw exactly the containers pause froze, release the session, and tell it to continue
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBwerkmeister resume\fR [feature]
.SH DESCRIPTION
.PP
Thaws exactly the containers \fBwerkmeister pause\fR froze, releases the Claude session, and tells it to continue if the pause cut a turn short.
.SH EXAMPLES
.PP
.nf
.RS 4
werkmeister resume my\-feature
.RE
.fi
.SH SEE ALSO
\fBwerkmeister\fR(1)
